  "bodyHash": "5a992d4692b40d4f",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一個由 Serilum 製作的模組。充滿愛心打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Tree Harvester 是一個可自訂的模組，允許透過砍伐單一基礎方塊來立即採收樹木、扭曲樹幹與巨大蘑菇。這可以是樹木的任何一部分。樹苗將自動根據樹木掉落的物品進行替換。模組內建許多檢查機制，從防止意外採收用原木搭建的房屋，到決定哪些葉子應該衰減。<br><br>預設情況下，只有按住蹲下按鈕時才能進行採收，但這可以在設定檔中切換。更多功能範例請見下方。有許多設定選項可讓您完全按照喜好調整模組。<br><br>本模組是為配合我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/ore-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ore Harvester</a> 模組而開發。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>預設設定下的功能：</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>所有樹木（原版與模組新增）均可透過蹲下並砍伐單一區塊來快速採收。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>砍伐樹木所需的時間取決於其中的原木數量。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>採收樹木後，葉子會迅速衰減。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>最後一片葉子衰減後，樹苗將自動替換。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>地獄中的扭曲樹幹可快速採收。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>巨大蘑菇同樣可以快速採收<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>可透過黑名單排除特定斧頭類型進行樹木採收。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>具備多項檢查機制以區分樹木與非樹木，避免意外破壞房屋。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>當兩種樹木相鄰時，僅會衰減被砍伐樹木的葉子。<br><strong>◉&nbsp; &nbsp;</strong>與其他模組相容。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"相依性\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg&w=668\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL 套件\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可自訂設定\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的設定選項：</span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>mustHoldAxeForTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，採收樹木時玩家主手必須持有斧頭。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>treeHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，不按蹲下鍵即可進行採收。若停用則相反，僅在蹲下時生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>automaticallyFindBottomBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">模組是否應嘗試尋找樹木實際的最底部原木並從該處開始採收。這意味著即使您在樹幹中間砍斷，它仍會完全倒下。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFastLeafDecay</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，周圍的葉子在樹木被砍伐後會迅速消失。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableNetherTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，地獄中的扭曲樹幹／緋紅樹幹也會被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableHugeMushrooms</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，巨型蘑菇也會被快速砍伐。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>ignorePlayerMadeTrees</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，由玩家放置葉子組成的樹木將不會被摧毀。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceSaplingOnTreeHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，採收樹木時會自動使用掉落物替換樹苗。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>replaceMushroomOnMushroomHarvest</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，當採收巨大蘑菇且「enableHugeMushrooms」啟用時，會自動使用掉落物替換蘑菇菇柄。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，每採收一根原木，所持斧頭會消耗耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 1.0, min 0.001, max 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">您可在此設定砍伐樹木應從斧頭扣除多少耐久度。例如設為 0.1，表示每砍伐 10 根原木扣除 1 點耐久。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，玩家疲勞值會隨採收的原木增加，每次增加 0.005（Minecraft 原版每破壞方塊的基準值）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 1.0, min 0.001, max 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">這決定每採收一根原木應為玩家增加多少疲勞值。預設為 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerLog</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">若啟用，採收時間會隨著樹木中的原木數量增加。具體數值由「increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier」決定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 0.1, min 0.01, max 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用「increaseHarvestingTimePerLog」時，採收樹木所需時間的增加幅度。實際速度計算方式為：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerLogModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountOfLeavesBrokenPerTick</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;default 3, min 1, max 16</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">樹木被採收後，每個遊戲刻應破壞多少片葉子。提高此數值會加快葉子衰減速度，但會增加每刻的運算負擔。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>斧頭黑名單功能：</strong></span><br>您可以僅允許特定斧頭進行樹木採收。首次載入模組時會生成一個黑名單檔案，位於 <strong><em>./config/treeharvester/harvestable_axe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能同樣適用於模組新增的斧頭道具。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/blacklist.jpg\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>採收緊鄰另一棵橡樹的白樺樹。僅白樺樹葉會衰減：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/birch_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵巨大的橡樹：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_oak_only.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>一棵 2x2 大小的雲杉樹。砍伐所需時間較長，且全部 4 棵樹苗皆正確替換：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/big_spruce.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>適用於扭曲（地獄）樹木：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/nether_tree.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>同樣適用於巨大蘑菇，這裡是一顆棕色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/brown_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>以及一顆紅色蘑菇：</strong></span></p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳細內容</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/tree-harvester/red_mushroom.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>只要下載檔案仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內，您即可自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的總覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，歡迎前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github 倉庫</a>。感謝支持！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
